{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sendBadges:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@NSInteger","text":"NSInteger"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"badge","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"badge","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The current application badge number (0 to clear badge)."}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Reports the current badge count to Pushwoosh for analytics and to enable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"badge-based segmentation. This is useful for:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Analytics"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Track user engagement through unread counts","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Segmentation"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Target users with high\/low badge counts","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Badge management","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Allow server-side badge manipulation","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Call this method whenever you update the app badge to keep Pushwoosh in sync.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Example","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Sync badge with Pushwoosh when updating unread counts:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["class NotificationBadgeManager {","","    private(set) var unreadCount: Int = 0 {","        didSet {","            updateBadge()","        }","    }","","    func markAsRead(_ notificationIds: [String]) {","        unreadCount = max(0, unreadCount - notificationIds.count)","    }","","    func handleNewNotification() {","        unreadCount += 1","    }","","    func clearAll() {","        unreadCount = 0","    }","","    private func updateBadge() {","        \/\/ Update system badge","        if #available(iOS 16.0, *) {","            UNUserNotificationCenter.current().setBadgeCount(unreadCount)","        } else {","            UIApplication.shared.applicationIconBadgeNumber = unreadCount","        }","","        \/\/ Sync with Pushwoosh","        Pushwoosh.configure.sendBadges(unreadCount)","    }","}","","\/\/ Usage in AppDelegate","class AppDelegate: UIApplicationDelegate {","","    func applicationDidBecomeActive(_ application: UIApplication) {","        \/\/ Sync current badge state when app becomes active","        let currentBadge = application.applicationIconBadgeNumber","        Pushwoosh.configure.sendBadges(currentBadge)","    }","}"]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/sendbadges:"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/sendBadges:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Type Method","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)sendBadges:","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sendBadges:","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"sendBadges:","symbolKind":"method","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"sendBadges:"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Synchronizes the application badge number with Pushwoosh servers."}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/sendBadges:":{"title":"sendBadges:","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Synchronizes the application badge number with Pushwoosh servers.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"sendBadges:"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/sendBadges:","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"sendBadges:"}],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/sendbadges:"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","role":"collection","title":"PushwooshCore","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"type":"topic"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","title":"PWConfiguration","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PWConfiguration"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","role":"symbol","abstract":[]}}}